                    States and Canada relating to the allocation of tariff quota on heavy cattle
                    during the calendar year 1942</head>
                <p>[For Presidential proclamation and related notes exchanged between the
                    Governments of the United States and Canada pursuant to the reciprocal
                    allocation of tariff quota on heavy cattle during the calendar year 1942, see
